missible"],"boundary":"Ordinary authored deduction checked against retained mathematical inputs; no new Lean declaration, elaborated dependency, cross-model transport, Comparator acceptance or independent proof certification is asserted.","citation_ids":["authored_r8_support_fixed_time_spatial_coercivity_at_jumps"],"evidence_ids":["ordinary_deductions_review_20261026"],"id":"support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity_at_jumps","kind":"claim","label":"Spatial coercivity at a coefficient jump","locator":"Long reasoning record #fixed-time-jump-extension","source_id":"authored_long_comparisons_20261024","statement":"For admissible gamma, 0<t<1 and c=gamma(t)>0, E[d^2-12*c*a*b^2+6*c^2*a^4]>=(c^2/1000)E[a^4], with a=Phi_xx,b=Phi_xxx,d=Phi_xxxx along its diffusion at t. Flattening gamma to c on [t-delta,t+delta) has L1 error<=2delta gamma(t+delta0), so local boundedness suffices to pass spatial moments even at jumps. This changes no retained Lean continuity hypothesis and asserts no time derivative at a jump.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity_at_jumps","relations":[{"derived":true,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity_at_jumps","id":"field:04405df512aa7229981a7b31c8f20ecae2fec7dd04e83238c51c52f3047a9b04","kind":"assumption_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity_at_jumps","semantic_class":"explicit_assumption_reference","source_field":"assumption_ids","to":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/scalar.paper_admissible"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity_at_jumps","id":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6d